def find_Max(arr, left, right):
    if left == right:
        return arr[left]

    mid = (left + right) // 2

    # If mid element is greater than next element, then mid is the maximum
    if arr[mid] > arr[mid + 1]:
        return find_Max(arr, left, mid)

    # If rightmost element is greater than mid element, then maximum is in right half
    if arr[right] > arr[mid]:
        return find_Max(arr, mid + 1, right)

    # Otherwise, maximum is in left half
    return find_Max(arr, left, mid)
```

